### 3. Detailed Component Specifications

#### 3.1 Top Navigation & Status Bar
* **Brand Logo:** AuthSentry identity icon featuring an iridescent circular multi-layer gradient with an embedded cybersecurity crest, followed by `AuthSentry` in geometric clean typography.
* **Central Executive Telemetry Pill (Crucial Element from Reference):**
  * Dark pill background (`#0b1019`) with a 1px border.
  * Left Indicator: Blue/red segmented bar icon with `+4.2x` tag.
  * Segment 1: `Active Risk Index: 74 / 100` (Bold white font).
  * Divider: Thin vertical separator.
  * Segment 2: `Baseline Risk: 18 / 100` (Muted cyan font).
  * Segment 3: `Identity attack velocity is 4.2x above corporate baseline` (Highlighted red/amber warning text).
* **Right Controls:**
  * Live Telemetry Stream toggle (Day/Night or Stream On/Off pill).
  * Notification Bell with live red badge (`5` active incidents).
  * Forensic Export icon (`🗂️` / Audit logs).
  * User profile avatar with verified badge.

---

#### 3.2 Hero Left Widget: Identity Attack Surface & 6-Axis Radar Chart
* **Header:**
  * Breadcrumb link: `< Threat Report` with red badge `[CRITICAL ATTACK / SUBOPTIMAL]`.
  * Title: `Identity Attack Surface & Posture`.
  * Subtitle: `Measures organization identity vulnerability, credential stuffing velocity, and session hijacking risk across all connected IdPs.`
* **6-Axis Interactive Hexagonal Radar Chart:**
  * Dark concentric grid lines with numeric scales (0, 20, 40, 60, 80, 100).
  * Neon Cyan polygon filled with translucent glow (`rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.2)`):
    1. **Credential Velocity:** `85%` (Brute-force frequency)
    2. **Geo Velocity:** `78%` (Impossible travel delta)
    3. **MFA Integrity:** `70%` (Push-bombing fatigue)
    4. **Device Trust:** `65%` (Hardware fingerprint novelty)
    5. **Network Hygiene:** `80%` (Tor exit / Cloud Datacenter ASN)
    6. **Privilege Flow:** `60%` (Password reset post-failure)

---

#### 3.3 Hero Centerpiece: The Living Celestial Radial Threat Arc (The Central Bar)
The definitive visual anchor of the dashboard. Must look **alive and pulsating**:
* **Concentric Orbital Track Rings:**
  * 3 layered concentric arcs with tick-mark graduations (SVG path with dash-arrays).
  * Rings rotate slowly (subtle CSS orbital rotation: 60s per turn).
* **Main Semicircular Threat Gauge Arc:**
  * Thick glowing arc spanning $-180^\circ$ to $0^\circ$ (semicircle).
  * Filled gradient: Electric Cyan $\rightarrow$ Amber $\rightarrow$ Radiant Crimson.
  * Animated needle/cap with a glowing cyan dot at the **74% mark**.
* **Center Metric Typography:**
  * Massive bold typography: **`74`** with superscript **`th`** in Slate 400.
  * Sub-label: `Percentile`.
  * Description underneath: `Organizational Attack Risk Probability`.
* **5 Floating Satellite Threat Nodes (Positioned along outer concentric arcs):**
  Each satellite node features a glowing category icon, percentage value, and attack vector label:
  1. `4.94%` • `Rapid Token Exfiltration` (Top-left arc)
  2. `14.45%` • `Tor / Datacenter Proxy Routing` (Mid-left arc)
  3. `17.54%` • `MFA Push Fatigue / Bombing` (Top center arc)
  4. `17.32%` • `Impossible Travel (>8,000 km/h)` (Mid-right arc)
  5. `34.21%` • `Distributed Credential Stuffing` (Far-right arc)
* **Living Telemetry Dynamics:**
  * Dotted satellite pins pulse subtly (`animate-ping` micro-elements).
  * Hovering any satellite node illuminates its specific arc segment and highlights related events in the lower cards.

---

#### 3.4 Hero Right Widget: Session Token Entropy & 24h Risk Line Chart
* **Top Metric Card:**
  * Value: `5.2 hrs` with status pill `[● Medium]`.
  * Title: `Session Token Lifetime & Entropy`.
  * Description: `Active OAuth refresh token lifetime exceeds zero-trust policy by 3.4 hours.`
* **Real-Time 24-Hour Line Chart:**
  * High-resolution SVG / Canvas line chart with dark grid lines.
  * Cyan line with subtle drop shadow and plotted data circles at 10, 20, 30, 40, 50-hour mark.
  * Y-axis: Risk Index / Velocity; X-axis: Time (hours).
  * Sharp drop-off or elevation spike showing the attack anomaly window.
* **Footer Button:** `[View full incident report >]` with right arrow.

---

#### 3.5 Bottom Card 1: Identity Risk Score & Epigenetic Anomaly Signatures
* **Upper Section:**
  * Title: `Identity Risk Score` with `[View report >]` button.
  * Explanation: `An identity risk score of 0.76 (76/100) indicates an active Account Takeover (ATO) pattern requiring containment.`
  * Metrics: **`0.76`** `(Equal to 76)` | **`0.15`** `Corporate Baseline` | Status `[● High / Critical]`.
  * **Gradient Barometer Scale:**
    * Smooth horizontal bar: Low (Emerald) $\rightarrow$ Medium (Yellow) $\rightarrow$ High (Crimson).
    * White rounded slider indicator positioned at 76%.
* **Lower Section (Nested Dark Card): Identity Anomaly Signatures:**
  * Category Header: `● Primary Attack Indicators`
  * 2-Column List with disclosure chevrons:
    * `▸ Rapid Failures (7 in 30s)` | `▸ Tor Exit Node 185.220.101.5`
    * `▸ Distributed Subnet Spray`  | `▸ Datacenter ASN (Hetzner Cloud)`
    * `▸ MFA Push Fatigue (4 triggers)` | `▸ Headless Python User-Agent`

---

#### 3.6 Bottom Card 2: Identity Hygiene & Behavioral Telemetry (The Table)
* **Header:**
  * Title: `Identity Hygiene & Behavioral Baseline`.
  * Main Ratio: `Legitimate vs Anomalous Logins: 60-80% [Current: 62%]`.
* **Telemetry Telemetry Rows:**
  Each row contains the metric name, standard acceptable range, measured value, and an info tooltip `(?)`:
  1. `Known Corporate Hardware`: Range `60-80%` | Current `74%` `[NORMAL]`
  2. `Residential ISP Origin`: Range `80-95%` | Current `48%` `[SUBOPTIMAL]`
  3. `Working Hours Alignment`: Range `85-95%` | Current `42%` `[ANOMALOUS]`
  4. `MFA Challenge Success`: Range `90-100%` | Current `55%` `[FATIGUE RISK]`
* **Bottom Summary Indices (Numbered Pills):**
  * `1 Device Trust Index: Suboptimal 1.4` `(?)`
  * `2 Identity Velocity Ratio: Elevated 4.2x` `(?)`

---

#### 3.7 Bottom Card 3: Threat Surface, Spectrum Gauge & Autonomous Response
* **Header:**
  * Title: `Threat Surface & Account Takeover Velocity`.
  * Subtitle: `ITDR Threat Intensity (Credential Velocity & Risk)`.
* **Top Metric & Horizontal Rainbow Spectrum Bar:**
  * Metric: **`Velocity: 8,820 km/h`** | **`Percentile: 94th`**.
  * **Rainbow Spectrum Bar:** Continuous gradient: Deep Blue $\rightarrow$ Emerald $\rightarrow$ Yellow $\rightarrow$ Orange $\rightarrow$ Neon Red.
  * White pin marker locked at the **94th percentile**.
* **Diagnostic Assessment Box:**
  * Text: *"This means identity anomalies are higher than 94% of reference enterprise baselines, indicating an active, distributed credential compromise."*
* **Change Over Time:** `+42.8% ↑ last hour`.
* **Forensic Bullet Findings:**
  * `▸ Indicates an ongoing Impossible Travel event (San Francisco to Frankfurt in 8 min).`
  * `▸ 5 failed login attempts preceded immediate password reset request.`
  * `▸ Active session tokens vulnerable to exfiltration.`
* **Autonomous Mitigation Control:**
  * Glowing action pill / button: **`[✨ Instant Session Kill-Switch / Mitigate]`** with an iridescent glowing crest.

---

### 4. Technical & Animation Architecture

#### 4.1 "Living" Animation Rules
* **Orbital Gauge Micro-Rotation:** Continuous 45s smooth CSS rotation on the outer concentric dotted ring:
  ```css
  @keyframes orbitRotate {
    from { transform: rotate(0deg); }
    to { transform: rotate(360deg); }
  }
  ```
* **Radar Chart Breathing Effect:** Sub-pixel scale oscillation (1.00 to 1.02) over a 4-second sinusoidal easing curve.
* **Telemetry Data Tick:** Every 3 seconds, sub-metrics (e.g. Velocity: 8,820 $\leftrightarrow$ 8,824 km/h) adjust slightly with smooth number transitions to convey continuous active sensor polling.
* **DEFCON Pulse:** Outer border of the central top pill pulses with `rgba(244, 63, 94, 0.35)` when in DEFCON 1 state.

#### 4.2 Color Palette Tokens
| Token | Hex Code | Purpose |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `cyber-canvas` | `#080c14` | Atmospheric outer canvas |
| `cyber-surface` | `#0e1420` | Glassmorphic panel base |
| `cyber-border` | `#23324a` | 1px precision card borders |
| `cyber-cyan` | `#00f0ff` | Primary telemetry, safe baseline |
| `cyber-amber` | `#f59e0b` | Elevated anomaly, warning indicators |
| `cyber-crimson` | `#f43f5e` | Critical attacks, ATO probability |
| `cyber-violet` | `#a855f7` | Behavioral UEBA, AI insights |

